+### 2026-11-05: Stage 414 (Styles v75: KH2 weapon effect previews)
+- Replace numbered Ventus/Dark Riku animation galleries with39 individual KH2
+  effect elements in Passives66..104. Keep numeric row labels; description
+  shows effect name, package family/element ID and runtime readiness.
+- Preview one element at a time, repeated on a finite180-game-frame cycle.
+  No body profile, script, attack, sound or resource writes. Stances coexist.
+- Migrate old animation-test flags off; retain unrelated numeric flags. Keep
+  both generated animation headers exact and retain all main stance behavior.
+- Source, confidence and validation: docs/styles-v75.md and combat-model.md.
+  KH2 only; no KH1/BBS demos. Final game/GPU appearance remains a live check.
+- Validation:665 Rust checks/30 suites and9 focused final-PE C/menu checks pass,
+  including39 descriptions and all12 stance coexistence paths. Both private
+  headers remain byte exact to v74. Rust render/GPU dispatch is not live tested.
+
 ### 2026-11-05: Stage 413 (Styles v74: native Overdrive continuity and color tuning)
 - Control blue #0055FF and Will purple #400060; palette3 selectively upgrades
   the two previous defaults while preserving other/custom version2 colors.
